        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="key-features">
        <h3>🎯 核心内容</h3>
        <div class="features-grid">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <h4>📊 因子挖掘与构建</h4>
            <p>Alpha因子构建、特征工程、因子有效性检验、多因子模型优化</p>
            <div class="feature-details">
              <ul>
                <li>价值因子：P/E、P/B、EV/EBITDA等</li>
                <li>成长因子：营收增长、利润增长、ROE等</li>
                <li>质量因子：财务健康度、盈利稳定性</li>
                <li>动量因子：价格动量、盈利动量、分析师修正</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <h4>🧠 机器学习应用</h4>
            <p>深度学习、集成学习、强化学习在量化投资中的应用</p>
            <div class="feature-details">
              <ul>
                <li>监督学习：回归预测、分类模型</li>
                <li>无监督学习：聚类分析、降维技术</li>
                <li>深度学习：神经网络、LSTM、Transformer</li>
                <li>强化学习：Q-learning、策略梯度方法</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <h4>⚡ 高频交易策略</h4>
            <p>微观结构分析、延迟优化、套利策略、做市策略</p>
            <div class="feature-details">
              <ul>
                <li>统计套利：配对交易、均值回归</li>
                <li>事件驱动：财报发布、并购重组</li>
                <li>技术分析：技术指标量化、趋势跟踪</li>
                <li>算法交易：TWAP、VWAP、POV执行</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <h4>🛡️ 风险管理体系</h4>
            <p>VaR模型、压力测试、组合优化、实时风控</p>
            <div class="feature-details">
              <ul>
                <li>风险度量：VaR、CVaR、最大回撤</li>
                <li>压力测试：历史情景、蒙特卡洛模拟</li>
                <li>组合优化：均值方差、风险平价、Black-Litterman</li>
                <li>实时监控：仓位控制、止损止盈、异常检测</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="technical-stack">
        <h3>🛠️ 技术栈</h3>
        <div class="tech-categories">
          <div class="tech-category">
            <h4>编程语言</h4>
            <div class="tech-items">
              <span class="tech-item">Python</span>
              <span class="tech-item">R</span>
              <span class="tech-item">C++</span>
              <span class="tech-item">Julia</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-category">
            <h4>数据科学库</h4>
            <div class="tech-items">
              <span class="tech-item">pandas</span>
              <span class="tech-item">numpy</span>
              <span class="tech-item">scipy</span>
              <span class="tech-item">scikit-learn</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-category">
            <h4>量化平台</h4>
            <div class="tech-items">
              <span class="tech-item">QuantConnect</span>
              <span class="tech-item">Zipline</span>
              <span class="tech-item">Backtrader</span>
              <span class="tech-item">VectorBT</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tech-category">
            <h4>数据源</h4>
            <div class="tech-items">
              <span class="tech-item">Yahoo Finance</span>
              <span class="tech-item">Alpha Vantage</span>
              <span class="tech-item">IEX Cloud</span>
              <span class="tech-item">Quandl</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="practical-examples">
        <h3>💡 实战案例</h3>
        <div class="examples-grid">
          <div class="example-card">
            <h4>多因子选股策略</h4>
            <p>基于Fama-French三因子模型，结合价值、成长、质量因子构建选股策略</p>
            <div class="code-preview">
              <pre><code># 因子计算示例
def calculate_factors(data):
    # 价值因子
    pe_factor = 1 / data['pe_ratio']
    pb_factor = 1 / data['pb_ratio']
    
    # 成长因子
    revenue_growth = data['revenue'].pct_change(12)
    profit_growth = data['net_income'].pct_change(12)
    
    # 质量因子
    roe = data['net_income'] / data['equity']
    debt_ratio = data['debt'] / data['assets']
    
    return pd.DataFrame(&#123;
        'value_score': (pe_factor + pb_factor) / 2,
        'growth_score': (revenue_growth + profit_growth) / 2,
        'quality_score': roe - debt_ratio
    &#125;)</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="example-card">
            <h4>机器学习预测模型</h4>
            <p>使用随机森林和XGBoost预测股票未来收益，结合特征工程提升预测精度</p>
            <div class="code-preview">
              <pre><code># 机器学习模型示例
from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestRegressor
import xgboost as xgb

def build_ml_model(features, target):
    # 特征工程
    features_processed = preprocess_features(features)
    
    # 模型训练
    rf_model = RandomForestRegressor(n_estimators=100, random_state=42)
    xgb_model = xgb.XGBRegressor(n_estimators=100, random_state=42)
    
    # 模型集成
    rf_model.fit(features_processed, target)
    xgb_model.fit(features_processed, target)
    
    return rf_model, xgb_model</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="example-card">
            <h4>风险平价组合</h4>
            <p>基于风险平价理论构建投资组合，实现风险分散和收益优化</p>
            <div class="code-preview">
              <pre><code># 风险平价组合示例
def risk_parity_portfolio(returns, target_risk=0.1):
    # 计算协方差矩阵
    cov_matrix = returns.cov()
    
    # 风险平价权重
    inv_vol = 1 / np.sqrt(np.diag(cov_matrix))
    weights = inv_vol / inv_vol.sum()
    
    # 调整到目标风险水平
    portfolio_vol = np.sqrt(weights.T @ cov_matrix @ weights)
    weights = weights * (target_risk / portfolio_vol)
    
    return weights</code></pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="learning-resources">
        <h3>📚 学习资源</h3>
